<div class="worlds-beyond wb-roll-card wb-block-card">
  <h3>Block{{#if ally}} for an ally{{/if}}</h3>
  {{#if incoming}}<p class="wb-roll-note">{{incoming.attackerName}} · {{incoming.weaponName}} · attack {{incoming.total}}{{#if incoming.targetName}} → {{incoming.targetName}}{{/if}}{{#if incoming.overwhelmingForce}} · Overwhelming Force{{/if}}</p>{{/if}}
  <p>{{#if spent}}1 reaction spent{{else}}No reaction spent{{/if}}.</p>
  {{{rollHTML}}}
  <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>Apply Block</summary><p>If resistant, halve the incoming damage first, rounded down. Subtract Armor Rating, then subtract this Block total. Overwhelming Force then raises damage back to half the original, rounded down, if those reductions brought it lower. Change Health manually. A full Block also stops effects that need to cut into you.</p></details>
</div>
